practice_questions.question_text:
Trace the following Python function for gcd_step(30,18), showing each recursive call and the final return.
def gcd_step(a, b):
    if b == 0:
        return a
    return gcd_step(b, a % b)

verification.test_code:
def gcd_step(a, b):
    if b == 0:
        return a
    return gcd_step(b, a % b)
assert gcd_step(30,18)==6
assert gcd_step(9,0)==9

